  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your toughness allows you to shrug off assaults that would devastate others.</p><p>Whenever you make a Saving Throw, roll 1d6 and add the die to your Saving Throw total. If applying this bonus to a death Saving Throw increases the total to 20 or higher, you gain the benefits of rolling a 20 on the d20.</p>",
